<title>USA: McMinnville, Ore. won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>McMinnville, Ore. won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $7.415 million of McMinnville, Ore., general obligation transportation project bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.747 percent.</p>
</text>
